D. Release gates
Do not turn on the policy until:
The additive schema and follow-up RPC migration pass in an isolated Testnet test environment.
The staker fee and owner fee are demonstrably paid by the initiating user, not silently deducted from project funds.
The recipient receives the exact requested amount.
All project reserves and platform fee ledger records reconcile to the verified transactions.
No two requests can reuse one fee payment or one payout.
Coverage/approval locks are checked inside the database transaction.
Mainnet reads/writes are proven absent in logs/tests.
Supabase security advisors and RLS/grant review pass.
Only then may the Testnet feature be activated by an explicit ALBUKHR administrator action.
